	(text "OOMWOO rear docking IR board (rev 1, 2026-10-28). Two top-looking 38 kHz receivers (the same part as the side board\nand the dock's U8202) look out of the board face, which faces backward. Put them ~10 mm apart with a baffle between\nthem: both see the dock = it is straight behind, one = steer that way. The outputs have internal pull-ups.\nRefs 86xx: unique on the OOMWOO panel."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 30.48 25.4 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.524 1.524)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "867c334c-f4f6-405e-8968-ab0ca26ba581")
	)
	(text "U8601 = left, U8602 = right, seen from behind the robot\n(looking at the board face)."
